# Run r1102 (2026-11-02), Boot 0: the OLD world for SQ-CDJ-11 / SQ-CDJ-05. Server from prep_srv.sh (group A, level cdj5)
# plus the five pre-nest jars from development/creativeDelight/jar_archive/displaced/ copied into OUT/srv/mods/ (they win
# over the nested copies). Everything is placed relative to the marker tagged cdj5home (offsets shared with the Boot 1+
# batches, see README.txt in this folder).
pace 2

## SQ-CDJ-11 | old world: pre-nest jars load and their blocks are placed
bootexpect Done \(
bootexpect \[creativedelight\] members:
count is loaded from backported.*not from the Creative Delight jar >= 0
shell grep -cE "is loaded from .*backported.*not from the Creative Delight jar" logs/latest.log; grep -oE "member [a-z_]+ is loaded from [^ ,]+" logs/latest.log | sort -u
> execute unless entity @e[type=minecraft:marker,tag=cdj5home] run summon minecraft:marker ~ ~ ~ {Tags:["cdj5home"]}
sleep 2
> data get entity @e[type=minecraft:marker,tag=cdj5home,limit=1] Pos
capture H entity data: \[(-?\d+)\.\d+d, (-?\d+)\.\d+d, (-?\d+)\.\d+d\]
> forceload add {H1} {H3} {H1+16} {H3+16}
sleep 3
> fill {H1} {H2} {H3} {H1+12} {H2+3} {H3+8} minecraft:air
